# Implementation Plan - Complete Flutter Mobile & Desktop Framework Isolation

Organize the `flutter/` directory into **`flutter/mobile/`** and **`flutter/desktop/`** without losing or omitting any existing Flutter agents, skills, or architecture plans. Both `flutter/mobile/` and `flutter/desktop/` will be completely self-contained and independently shippable.

---

## Complete Inventory Matrix

### 1. Agents (`agents/`)
Both targets will receive the full agent team tailored for their target platform:
- `implementer.agent.md`: Writes production code for Flutter mobile or desktop.
- `orchestrator.agent.md`: Sequences multi-agent workflow.
- `planner.agent.md`: Analyzes requirements and produces 6-step implementation plans.
- `reviewer.agent.md`: Audits code quality, state management, and performance.
- `tester.agent.md`: Runs `flutter test` and `flutter analyze`.
- `release-specialist.agent.md` (Desktop only): Manages Windows packaging (`build_release.ps1`), MSVC DLL bundling, and NSIS setup installer.

### 2. Architecture Plans (`architecture_plans/`)
- **`flutter/desktop/architecture_plans/`**:
  - `flutter-hardware-integration.md` (Desktop serial port communication)
  - `flutter-local-database.md` (Drift SQLite database)
  - `flutter-state-management.md` (Provider reactive state)
- **`flutter/mobile/architecture_plans/`**:
  - `flutter-local-database.md` (Drift SQLite database)
  - `flutter-state-management.md` (Provider reactive state)

### 3. Skills Catalog (`skills/`)
